  model: '(a) f = c/λ = 3.00×10⁸/(6.00×10⁻⁷) = 5.0×10¹⁴ Hz.\n(b) λ = v/f = 340/1700 = 0.20 m.\n(c) Light is transverse (and needs no medium); sound is longitudinal and needs a medium.',
